1
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:21,000
Here's a pass from Itoshi Sae to Shidou Ryusei!!

2
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,790
It's a dangerous attack for Japan U-20!

3
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:23,710
What a play!

4
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,750
Go!

5
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,980
Turn the score around!

6
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:38,600
Copied with 99% accuracy.

7
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:44,480
Wow! The newly entered number 14, Mikage Reo, cleared it!

8
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,450
What a skillful defense!

9
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,860
What a great clearance!

10
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,820
I won't let it end with me as a defender!

11
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,530
...I will win this match.

12
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:57,550
...And I'll strive to become a forward again!

13
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,490
...I will win... and play alongside him again!

14
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,340
Incredible!

15
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:12,210
...Hiori's inspiration broke our stagnation and increased our attacking variety.

16
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:18,520
...And Reo's chameleon defensive style stopped Shidou.

17
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,010
...Our substitutions proved successful.

18
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:24,430
...Our team has started to regain momentum!

19
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,290
...Now all that's left is for me to score.

20
00:01:29,210 --> 00:01:32,790
...But I can't do anything unless I get past their captain.

21
00:01:34,250 --> 00:01:35,820
...I have to crush Aiku.

22
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:38,420
...And I need to gather the pieces for that!

23
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:19,670
Did you see that?! Sae-kun's passes are truly perfect!

24
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:25,940
...I don't know why... but that player caught my attention.

25
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:28,800
Hey, Itoshi Sae.

26
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,560
That pass was great.

27
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:34,650
Playing football with you is really fun!

28
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:37,780
It's like my brain is being stimulated by electricity!

29
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,240
What exactly do you mean...?

30
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,290
...I don't know.

31
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:47,660
...But it feels like my freedom is being understood for the first time.

32
00:03:48,350 --> 00:03:50,620
...I feel like my big bang is about to come!

33
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:54,580
...I got the message that you're happy.

34
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:59,420
Now go and score more goals, you devil.

35
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:04,010
...The world... still doesn't know me.

36
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:07,450
Passes? Plans?

37
00:04:07,450 --> 00:04:09,180
A guaranteed way to win?

38
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:12,460
How ridiculous.

39
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,670
How many times do I have to say it?

40
00:04:14,670 --> 00:04:18,270
Football is not a sport; it's a life activity!

41
00:04:18,980 --> 00:04:21,510
My weapon is my sharp spatial awareness.

42
00:04:21,970 --> 00:04:25,950
My entire being is focused on scoring goals and surviving on this pitch.

43
00:04:26,050 --> 00:04:28,360
...It's absolute mastery of scoring from inside the penalty area!

44
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:33,960
...As long as I'm inside it, I can sense the goal's opening even with my back turned!

45
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,130
Now pass! I want it right here, genius!

46
00:04:39,060 --> 00:04:43,260
All of my cells... were created to score!

47
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,470
I won't let you shoot!

48
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:48,390
...This bastard.

49
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:51,020
...He copied the bearded guy's technique too?

50
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:55,190
How skilled you are at imitating...! Are you some kind of imitation master?

51
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,720
Despite your words, you're losing to this imitator.

52
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,520
Maybe we should demote your rank from devil to punk.

53
00:05:01,450 --> 00:05:03,280
...You're nothing but...

54
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,450
...an imitator!

55
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:06,610
You were amazing, Reo!

56
00:05:06,610 --> 00:05:08,610
Keep cloning yourself onto him!

57
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,980
Push up! Push up!

58
00:05:14,530 --> 00:05:16,750
...I didn't explode enough.

59
00:05:18,490 --> 00:05:23,460
...All humans live to leave a trace of their existence.

60
00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:30,430
...Passing on your genes is precisely the survival instinct granted to all living beings.

61
00:05:31,070 --> 00:05:37,470
...Leaving memories by connecting with people is the same as leaving memories where you hurt them.

62
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:43,240
...The desire to create something... or the desire to become important.

63
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,700
...Or, of course, the desire to leave offspring.

64
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:50,270
...All of these are actions aimed at leaving a mark of your life in this world.

65
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:54,370
...And it just so happens that football is the only thing I want to leave my mark on.

66
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:59,330
...I have to focus... because for me, scoring...

67
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:03,090
...is an act of fertilization!

68
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,880
...I represent the genes... and the goal nets represent the egg.

69
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:10,640
...And that joyful birth...

70
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:18,730
...is what I call an explosion!

71
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:21,270
A very long pass...?

72
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:22,480
Damn! Get back!

73
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,570
...But it's impossible for anyone to respond to-

74
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:27,230
Someone is running reflexively...?

75
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,910
I got it!

76
00:06:31,070 --> 00:06:33,290
I completely slipped away!

77
00:06:33,290 --> 00:06:34,740
...Now it's just the goalkeeper in front of me.

78
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:37,760
Are you serious, you topknot?

79
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:40,380
I can't use my hands! So I'll head it!

80
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:41,500
Great job, Gagamaru!

81
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:42,860
Yesssss!

82
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:43,880
Good call!

83
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,530
...Damn.

84
00:06:46,530 --> 00:06:48,590
...We have to restart the attack from the beginning again.

85
00:06:58,870 --> 00:07:01,850
Wow...? What is this feeling I'm getting...?

86
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:06,140
...Even though I'm far from the goal... I can sense it behind me.

87
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:11,530
...All of my football cells...

88
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:18,950
...are dancing, telling me to explode!

89
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:23,130
...So you've arrived.

90
00:07:24,030 --> 00:07:25,310
At flow.

91
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:30,260
Big Bang Falling Explosion Shot!

92
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:40,930
...And now... to all the scum of the world who still don't know me...

93
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,350
...Take my goal.

94
00:07:43,970 --> 00:07:45,770
...Take my genes.

95
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:50,630
Directly into your wombs!

96
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,950
...Challenge-focused concentration.

97
00:08:00,770 --> 00:08:07,010
So the first one to reach flow in this match is you... Shidou Ryusei.

98
00:08:07,710 --> 00:08:12,420
Yeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeees!

99
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:14,520
Th-This is insane!

100
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:19,430
With a long-distance overhead kick, Japan U-20 turns the score around!

101
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:22,390
We did it! We turned the score around!

102
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:25,220
They did it, Special Advisor!

103
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:30,780
...Shidou Ryusei.

104
00:08:30,780 --> 00:08:33,280
It's his first appearance, but he's at the level of world stars!

105
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:38,570
That was incredible, Shidou-kun!

106
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,030
...What an amazing goal!

107
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:41,260
I scored, Itoshi Sae!

108
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:44,540
I'll play football with you forever and ever!

109
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:48,670
When I play with you, I feel emotions I've never felt before!

110
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,160
Die!

111
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:53,630
Didn't I tell you to score a hat-trick first?

112
00:08:54,070 --> 00:08:58,010
So don't you dare touch me before that, you lustful devil!

113
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,040
Okay, okay.

114
00:09:01,410 --> 00:09:05,250
Then I'll live with you if I score ten goals!

115
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:09,400
What on earth was that goal...?

116
00:09:10,290 --> 00:09:11,950
...It's unbelievably extraordinary!

117
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:15,850
...While none of us could handle Shidou,

118
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:20,410
...Itoshi Sae kept challenging him with his passes.

119
00:09:21,250 --> 00:09:24,170
...And Shidou lived up to those challenges.

120
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:28,800
...Shidou is definitely in a state of flow right now!

121
00:09:29,930 --> 00:09:31,120
...Damn it!

122
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:36,430
...He reached the state I wanted to reach... he reached where I should have reached!

123
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:42,890
Under the guidance of that genius Itoshi Sae... that devil awakened!

124
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,350
...They swallowed up all the momentum of this match.

125
00:09:49,430 --> 00:09:50,950
...At this rate, we will lose.

126
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:53,260
...At this rate, it's over for us!

127
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:56,620
...The one who will change Japanese football...

128
00:09:57,630 --> 00:10:01,320
...is it not us... but those two...?

129
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:05,060
...Is it us?

130
00:10:05,890 --> 00:10:06,860
...Is it me?

131
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:16,270
According to his data, Shidou-kun shouldn't be able to score a goal like that, Ego-san!

132
00:10:16,270 --> 00:10:18,230
He must have reached an awakening!

133
00:10:18,230 --> 00:10:20,540
Please! Do something!

134
00:10:21,330 --> 00:10:22,320
...I can't.

135
00:10:22,650 --> 00:10:24,470
...I no longer have a plan that covers beyond this.

136
00:10:25,690 --> 00:10:28,060
Wh... What are you talking about?!

137
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:30,460
If we lose, Blue Lock will be destroyed!

138
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:34,070
Everything we've done will have been for nothing!

139
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:34,070
Ego-san!

140
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:36,350
I don't want things to end like this!

141
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:38,110
What should we do?!

142
00:10:40,150 --> 00:10:43,790
We're fighting with all our strength, just as you told us!

143
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:45,490
But this isn't enough!

144
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:46,810
...Please tell me!

145
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:48,460
How can we win?

146
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:51,320
Are you both idiots?

147
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:55,000
Blue Lock has already won.

148
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,750
...Our overwhelming dominance in the first half.

149
00:10:58,750 --> 00:11:01,070
...Shidou Ryusei's rampage.

150
00:11:01,070 --> 00:11:03,390
Everything is going according to plan so far.

151
00:11:03,770 --> 00:11:08,850
...If we lose this match, Blue Lock and its philosophy might be destroyed.

152
00:11:08,850 --> 00:11:12,530
...And I might also be erased from the Japanese football world.

153
00:11:13,930 --> 00:11:14,860
...But...

154
00:11:15,310 --> 00:11:17,320
None of you will disappear.

155
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:25,490
...Shidou Ryusei, who caught the attention of Itoshi Sae, will become a starter for the national team.

156
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:30,640
And Itoshi Rin will join the national team as a star rivaling Shidou, without a doubt.

157
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:36,070
Prestigious universities and domestic league clubs will come clamoring for you.

158
00:11:36,070 --> 00:11:39,250
Opening the door to many opportunities.

159
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:43,330
The performance you've shown deserves everything I just mentioned.

160
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:47,780
...And in the future, the very fact that you entered Blue Lock...

161
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:50,270
...will be a great advantage for you.

162
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:55,070
Now that you've acquired the necessary egoism... you will change Japanese football!

163
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:59,860
So hold your head high and be proud! We've already won!

164
00:12:04,860 --> 00:12:06,210
...As if I care!

165
00:12:09,830 --> 00:12:11,660
The future of Japanese football?

166
00:12:12,990 --> 00:12:14,750
Future guarantees?

167
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:16,630
I don't care about any of that!

168
00:12:17,610 --> 00:12:18,590
...I...

169
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:19,960
...We...

170
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:23,120
We want to win this match!

171
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:25,640
...We don't want the future.

172
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,950
...Losing is the same as dying.

173
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:30,330
And we haven't died yet!

174
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:35,190
I don't need anything other than becoming the best in the world!

175
00:12:35,530 --> 00:12:37,690
...I-Isagi-kun.

176
00:12:38,690 --> 00:12:40,670
Make us win, you damn glasses guy!

177
00:12:41,450 --> 00:12:44,610
Isn't this the egoism you taught us?!

178
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:50,200
Alright, Isagi Yoichi.

179
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:56,890
We're moving to a plan whose outcome even I cannot predict.

180
00:12:58,340 --> 00:12:59,920
It's your turn, joker.

181
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,610
Barou Shoei.

182
00:13:05,020 --> 00:13:08,430
Waiting almost killed me... you damn bastard!

183
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:14,570
Fifteen minutes of the second half have passed!

184
00:13:14,570 --> 00:13:15,980
But wait!

185
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:19,610
Blue Lock is making another substitution while trailing in score!

186
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:26,630
The last player to be substituted will be Otoya Eita, and number 13 Barou Shoei will enter!

187
00:13:26,630 --> 00:13:28,530
So they're looking to reinforce the offense!

188
00:13:28,530 --> 00:13:30,770
Put a leash on that killing intent, King.

189
00:13:30,770 --> 00:13:32,460
The defenders will feel you from a mile away!

190
00:13:32,460 --> 00:13:35,000
Shut up. It's called Haki.

191
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,180
You'll play as right wing, Barou.

192
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:45,390
....Hiori will drop back and become the right full-back, so coordinate with him and-

193
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:45,980
Listen, you donkey.

194
00:13:46,370 --> 00:13:48,390
...I watched you from the bench.

195
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:51,760
And how boring your playing is!

196
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:53,520
...Shut up.

197
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:59,150
...This is our last substitution.

198
00:14:00,250 --> 00:14:03,460
...And having a brute force like Barou join our deadly offense...

199
00:14:03,460 --> 00:14:05,590
...is a sign of Ego's trust in us.

200
00:14:07,190 --> 00:14:10,880
We've barely practiced with this formation.

201
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:13,990
Will they really be okay without a plan, Ego-san...?

202
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:18,000
Putting in Barou Shoei was a plan I considered from the very beginning.

203
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:20,210
I have no intention of throwing in the towel.

204
00:14:20,850 --> 00:14:24,620
Didn't I tell you earlier that things are going exactly as I planned?

205
00:14:24,950 --> 00:14:28,170
Including the continuation of their desire to win.

206
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:32,260
But there's one thing I didn't account for.

207
00:14:32,710 --> 00:14:38,880
...The passion and egoism that grew inside them... was far more fiery than I expected.

208
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:41,360
....Then we still have a chance to w-

209
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,650
Shut up and watch.

210
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:50,640
In their current state... they might be able to create the most exciting and passionate moments in football.

211
00:14:53,290 --> 00:14:55,790
Welcome to the battlefield, King.

212
00:14:56,500 --> 00:14:59,750
Did you wither away after scoring one goal, you stinking one?

213
00:14:59,990 --> 00:15:01,840
You'd better pass to me.

214
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,490
In your dreams.

215
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:10,920
Hey guys... from now on, forget about team balance.

216
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:15,010
Everyone on the frontline, push forward and rely on all-out attack.

217
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:17,640
Let's win even if it means crushing each other!

218
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:19,730
Understood, Rin-chan!

219
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,350
I can see you're fired up, Captain!

220
00:15:22,710 --> 00:15:25,880
Ramble as you like, I have no intention of dying here.

221
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,860
Yeah... because we will win!

222
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:30,060
Yes! Let's go!

223
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:36,310
Our current formation is our strongest because it's an all-out attack.

224
00:15:37,150 --> 00:15:39,560
...Stealing goals is our only way.

225
00:15:41,110 --> 00:15:43,790
...To save Blue Lock!

226
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:51,170
...Barou's weapons are his violent dribbling and mid-range shots.

227
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:57,020
If Barou receives the ball in that zone, his chances of scoring will increase!

228
00:15:57,770 --> 00:16:00,060
...I'll guide Barou into his range.

229
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:03,560
...While I slip behind their defense trying to score myself!

230
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:06,670
Listen well, Barou Shoei.

231
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:10,280
...If Yukimiya Kenyu is still on the field when you come in,

232
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:13,610
you two should both dribble from the wings to break the opponent's formation.

233
00:16:13,970 --> 00:16:20,700
...I already told the rest of the team to build attacks based on your individual skills, but...

234
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,660
Forget that.

235
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:26,380
That's what I was planning to do anyway.

236
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:27,650
Great.

237
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:31,260
...What you need to do until the very last second of the match is...

238
00:16:31,940 --> 00:16:35,150
...not think about anything other than devouring Isagi Yoichi!

239
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:41,350
And now... what skills will you show us, number 13?

240
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,270
...Those two are still exchanging passes as usual.

241
00:16:44,740 --> 00:16:46,230
Aren't they going to use him?

242
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,440
Itoshi Rin passed backwards...?

243
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:53,890
Is that sky-blue-haired kid going to change the game somehow...?

244
00:16:54,730 --> 00:16:56,990
Here I go, forwards!

245
00:16:58,930 --> 00:17:00,820
They moved at the same time...?

246
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:02,250
...I'll go to the most dangerous one!

247
00:17:02,930 --> 00:17:05,140
...Sendou went to Itoshi Rin.

248
00:17:05,140 --> 00:17:06,710
...Which means the free one is...

249
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:09,410
Number 11!

250
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:13,340
He was late to notice me...! I can cut it off!

251
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:15,010
...I'll cu-

252
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,270
Barou?

253
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:24,730
What are you doing?!

254
00:17:24,730 --> 00:17:27,190
What am I doing? Are you blind?

255
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,650
I'm your hunter.

256
00:17:30,910 --> 00:17:33,110
He stole the ball from his teammate...?

257
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:36,360
This is illogical! As if I could predict an attack like this!

258
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:40,980
There is no selectiveness in Barou Shoei's playing style.

259
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:45,500
...That's why, the more you know about football, the easier it is to be deceived.

260
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:49,460
By his deadly flick!

261
00:17:50,260 --> 00:17:51,650
...A cut-in dribble!

262
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:53,210
So he does have real skill!

263
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:55,940
That's why he's the joker.

264
00:17:56,850 --> 00:18:03,390
A despotic king who is loyal to his own interests, wreaking havoc for them, caring for neither foe nor ally.

265
00:18:04,390 --> 00:18:07,350
Wreak havoc, Barou Shoei!

266
00:18:08,330 --> 00:18:10,770
...From now on, even I cannot predict...

267
00:18:12,210 --> 00:18:14,480
...what will happen in this final half hour!

268
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:19,770
Wow! Blue Lock's substitute number 13, Barou Shoei, breaks through!

269
00:18:19,770 --> 00:18:20,410
How fast!

270
00:18:20,510 --> 00:18:22,160
Is he going to shoot now?!

271
00:18:22,750 --> 00:18:27,750
What a strange joker you are, did you steal the ball from your teammate?

272
00:18:28,870 --> 00:18:30,800
...He took a glance at the penalty area.

273
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:31,840
Is he going to pass...?

274
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:35,460
...No... you're the type who wants to score their own goals, aren't you?

275
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:39,120
...But there's no angle to shoot where you're heading!

276
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,340
Pass, Barou!

277
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:43,410
...Number 11's movement speed is good.

278
00:18:43,410 --> 00:18:44,810
Is that his aim?

279
00:18:45,210 --> 00:18:51,540
Will he try to break through with quick passes? Or use him as bait to enter the penalty area?

280
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:54,230
To the outside?

281
00:18:55,270 --> 00:18:56,130
Barou!

282
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:56,940
This is bad!

283
00:18:57,590 --> 00:19:00,070
If he passes now, it'll be a guaranteed scoring opportunity!

284
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:04,830
Another cut-in dribble...?

285
00:19:04,830 --> 00:19:08,120
Impossible...! This kid is beyond comprehension!

286
00:19:08,410 --> 00:19:09,500
Pass it, Barou!

287
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:14,710
Even if the skies fall to the earth, Isagi... I will not pass to you!

288
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:19,880
I'll devour you and this match!

289
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:21,890
How crazy!

290
00:19:24,610 --> 00:19:25,740
This idiot!

291
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:28,810
You're going too far, you stupid king!

292
00:19:28,810 --> 00:19:31,850
He threw both his enemies and allies into chaos!

293
00:19:32,130 --> 00:19:33,100
Loose ball!

294
00:19:35,190 --> 00:19:36,820
The opponent's formation collapsed!

295
00:19:37,210 --> 00:19:40,530
Barou-kun's presence caused chaos all over the field!

296
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:43,240
I must identify the optimal target!

297
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:46,490
Let me see you try to get past me, Yuki-kun!

298
00:19:47,260 --> 00:19:49,290
My time to reach flow has come!

299
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:53,000
...Towards surpassing my best performance by a step!

300
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,710
Start!

301
00:19:54,710 --> 00:19:55,920
He leaned right!

302
00:19:56,850 --> 00:19:57,670
How fast!

303
00:19:58,560 --> 00:19:59,630
I can't shoot yet!

304
00:20:00,130 --> 00:20:01,550
I need to raise my pace even more!

305
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:04,800
I'll use the paths that became possible thanks to the chaos created by Barou-kun!

306
00:20:07,470 --> 00:20:11,310
A no-touch dribble at full speed?! And his touches are even faster than before!

307
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:15,810
...He's using players as obstacles to break through!

308
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:22,030
It's street-football-style dribbling!

309
00:20:22,310 --> 00:20:23,290
Get out of my way!

310
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:25,740
I have no time to waste on you!

311
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:28,370
He used Hayate's body well!

312
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:30,830
Damn! I'm half a step behind!

313
00:20:31,210 --> 00:20:33,330
...I see it... the best...

314
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:36,380
...shooting angle!

315
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,710
Shoot if you're a man, glasses guy!

316
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:40,090
How fast!

317
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:41,880
He blocked my shooting angle!

318
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,440
No, not yet!

319
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:46,550
...I must find it!

320
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:54,470
...My final shot that will lead me to...

321
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,980
...flow!

322
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:01,970
...Where are you shoot-

323
00:21:01,970 --> 00:21:03,440
...It's curving outward!

324
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,910
A spinning shot!

325
00:21:07,050 --> 00:21:09,170
A timely goal!

326
00:21:10,610 --> 00:21:14,080
So this feeling... is flow!

327
00:21:19,910 --> 00:21:20,960
Aiku!

328
00:21:25,290 --> 00:21:26,800
Did he read it...?

329
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:28,890
It was a spinning shot from his blind spot!

330
00:21:29,840 --> 00:21:33,100
No...! He just jumped there betting everything!

331
00:21:33,980 --> 00:21:37,900
...This is different from his style of moving after carefully observing.

332
00:21:38,250 --> 00:21:41,360
...It's defense based purely on gambling!

333
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:48,410
What on earth is this?! This feeling is incredible!

334
00:21:49,540 --> 00:21:54,580
I can see all the spots that pose a danger to our goal!

335
00:21:56,110 --> 00:21:59,330
No... my entire body... is sensing them!

336
00:22:00,360 --> 00:22:01,420
...Impossible!

337
00:22:02,970 --> 00:22:04,670
Did he also reach flow?!

338
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:13,140
I have always waited... for this moment!

339
00:23:44,310 --> 00:23:46,880
Blue Lock: Additional Time!

340
00:23:52,580 --> 00:23:55,830
Itoshi Sae cares a lot about his appearance!

341
00:23:55,830 --> 00:23:58,490
He's always perfect and cool! How amazing!

342
00:23:58,490 --> 00:24:01,470
I bet he's trying to marry an actress too!

343
00:24:01,470 --> 00:24:03,170
No, that's just your thinking!

344
00:24:03,170 --> 00:24:07,330
...Putting stuff on his skin and playing the role of an elegant prince...

345
00:24:07,330 --> 00:24:09,340
...How annoying!

346
00:24:10,380 --> 00:24:11,380
Is this his bag?

347
00:24:11,380 --> 00:24:15,210
Damn! Let's rummage through it quickly and see what's inside!

348
00:24:15,210 --> 00:24:17,680
Stop that! Haven't you heard of privacy?

349
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:18,570
A watch!

350
00:24:18,570 --> 00:24:19,730
How cool!

351
00:24:19,730 --> 00:24:21,270
Don't touch it too much!

352
00:24:21,270 --> 00:24:22,940
I bet it's expensive!

353
00:24:22,940 --> 00:24:24,750
Ointment and moisturizer!

354
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:25,840
He takes care of his beauty!

355
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:27,900
Skincare is very important!

356
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:29,690
I bet those are expensive too!

357
00:24:29,690 --> 00:24:30,830
Sunglasses!

358
00:24:30,830 --> 00:24:31,850
How stylish!

359
00:24:31,850 --> 00:24:33,670
It's necessary for celebrities, of course!

360
00:24:33,670 --> 00:24:35,910
I bet they cost a kidney!

361
00:24:37,080 --> 00:24:38,800
He really pisses me off!

362
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:41,040
He has a second bag!

363
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:43,710
Let's check it out right away!

364
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,670
What's this?

365
00:24:46,410 --> 00:24:47,200
Earrings?

366
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:47,770
What?!

367
00:24:47,770 --> 00:24:48,980
And they're women's earrings!

368
00:24:49,370 --> 00:24:50,600
A small mirror?

369
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:51,960
And women's polish?

370
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:53,390
A pink toothbrush!

371
00:24:53,390 --> 00:24:54,760
And a really cute shape!

372
00:24:54,760 --> 00:24:57,920
L-L-Lipstick?!

373
00:24:57,920 --> 00:25:00,620
W-W-Why?

374
00:25:01,670 --> 00:25:02,970
...Itoshi Sae.

375
00:25:02,970 --> 00:25:06,040
Could it be that he likes to dress as a girl?

376
00:25:06,040 --> 00:25:07,020
Wow!

377
00:25:08,100 --> 00:25:10,570
...It might actually suit him.

378
00:25:10,570 --> 00:25:14,570
Great! Bag rummaging is a huge success!

379
00:25:12,740 --> 00:25:17,580
A huge success!

380
00:25:14,570 --> 00:25:16,930
A huge success!

381
00:25:17,490 --> 00:25:20,580
...That stuff actually belongs to my ex-girlfriend.

382
00:25:21,950 --> 00:25:25,860
We broke up, but she left her overnight bag at my place.

383
00:25:25,860 --> 00:25:28,250
And I was planning to return it to her today.

384
00:25:28,620 --> 00:25:30,620
That's very misleading, you bastard!

385
00:25:30,620 --> 00:25:31,710
Your girlfriend...?

386
00:25:31,710 --> 00:25:33,340
What does overnight bag mean?

387
00:25:32,690 --> 00:25:38,050
...I'm dying... You're killing me, you dogs!

388
00:25:33,340 --> 00:25:35,570
Was she older than you? Do you like mature women?

389
00:25:35,570 --> 00:25:38,050
What does overnight bag mean?